<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez, president of Venezuela's National Assembly, and on the head of the legislature, reducing pressure on opposition leaders. The U.S. Space Force has deployed electromagnetic weapons and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, mirroring similar actions in Iran. Former President Nicolás Maduro is returning to a U.S. federal court to face torture allegations. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVXFnM3A0T3lJeVdPVnZrVlZHT3l6dlBUbjZkZGdmYTd4NTFkZEE1TkpOVkNxaXpoZVBiQUNSNWhrRGl4cXZxS2VWeHN5aVVfbEpSR2doM0xwR1JiZHA5VjdkLVhrVHhBMTlNQmQ1ZGNOSGd1bDhFOEFFQlpveFRpcG43MUZ1OEwwWGxqeXFrLUNwakUxOTU5R19rZEFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOOTlvMUpXbDJXOFQ2QXFGcm03VjFVMEx6anJzUkZIc2c1Ml84dWU5SkFKODUzelpWbnQ3UnIxY3NYZWpNaFcxV01jaTZwckZyLVlBRll1b1kxUGhseGpoV0M0RERCNlJQLWNmRnl0SFFWT2JRanlpQXJjZlNycWc5ZUhTMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOX0dPTzMxQmZlR2ROS0E2T3czWFg4ZVNHb1A3NG9fdmFsQzdhSG5YOTBMVHgxZzEyeTJpaWZYMHNuaW52WlZmNHItb1hmR2xha1ZtemVjSkw4U2psUzdNRVFGTmFUQXVJRmJudGVPMzFSRnFtSUhrQ1F3b3lvTERwVjI1VkkzUXZnaUo5U2Z3ZWRxNnl4S1ppRFJ6RlJ3WkZUNFpjZkM2OUw0NnV4MG5yUVQ1Zms0N25od1NySEZIUERMMjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPVHlqN2kxNDVvZ1p0dmhINWJTOWNBMmVrRkpueF9ocHBQNHhhbnl0cVA5c2hOVkVadzNINWdZTlZuX3lmdkhkOVVkdDJERjJSMzdOWkZOdVdqOG10bC05OUM1NHZ3VUVZU2FGRVczWmxuM2FucTNNZkdkaXN1NVJUVUduMDNNYlRFME9RQ3ZFc2